  "Datum: NAD83 (EPSG:26911, the cached tiles' own CRS) to WGS84 (EPSG:32611) via pyproj's default transform. In Nevada the unmodelled residual is of order 1 m, i.e. ~1 % of one competition cell and ~0.5 % of the 200 m gate. Logged, not load-bearing.",
